              "blocks": {
                "faq_1": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Can I make this without the thermometer?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "faq_1_a": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>The recipe is written around the temperature inside the roast, not a time, so it needs a leave-in thermometer of some kind. A basic probe gives you the core temperature. The Predictive Thermometer adds the countdown to when the roast will be ready and the surface reading, so you can time the sauce and the sides to it.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
